  "slug": "hlx-admin-api-executor-guarded",
  "name": "Hlx Admin Api Executor Guarded",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bundles the hlx-admin-api-executor skill with a PreToolUse hook that blocks any destructive curl command targeting admin.hlx.page before it executes. Claude must present a Change Justification (WHY/WHAT/HOW) and get explicit user approval before the command can run.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `hlx-admin-api-executor` (Interactive AEM Edge Delivery Services (EDS/Helix 5) Admin API executor with human-in-the-loop oversight) and **1 hook**, `PreToolUse`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hlx-admin-api-executor-guarded@claude-community` from `jackzhaojin/ai-builder-kit` (`plugins/hlx-admin-api-executor-guarded`).",
